      "title": "PFCP: Add Juniper dissector support for IEs 32911, 32918, and 32929",
      "message": "PFCP: Add Juniper dissector support for IEs 32911, 32918, and 32929\n\n- Dissect Error Event Report IE (32911) with ID, length, and description\n- Dissect Multicast Service Object IE (32918) including flags and threshold\n- Dissect DBNG INET TCP Address IE (32929) with nested Source IP Address structure\n",
